    }
    while (usbredirparser_has_data_to_write(parser.get())) {
        ret = usbredirparser_do_write(parser.get());
        ...
    }
}
```

So the loop continues while there's remaining input OR data to write. Each iteration drains write buffers at the end. So write buffers don't accumulate across iterations.

